          "text": "And a highway shall be there, and a way, and it shall be called, The way of holiness; the unclean shall not pass over it; but it ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "shall be",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " for those: the way-faring men, though fools, shall not err ",
